<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75992" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρ-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, of persons, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>inclined to make water much</i> or
			<i>often</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i><i>Acut.(Sp.</i>)<i><span class="en">
				52
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ λίαν οὐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				670b9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>promoting urine</i>, v. l. in <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				53
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				865a19
			</span></i>,al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶνος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ath.
					1.32c
				</span></i>
			 sq.: 
				Comp.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Diph.Siph.
			</span></i> ap.<i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				9.371b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.137
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>like urine</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀσμή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					908b2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγγεῖον, πόρος οὐ.,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρήθρα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.57
			</span></i> (cj.), <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				<u>UP</u>
				5.16
			</span></i>.</div>
